# Project Memory: PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial

## One-Line Understanding

NUNOX high-quality fabric sample scan trial for image quality and fabric/sample data foundation.

## Current Outcome

Evaluate whether scan output can support Sourcing, FD, CPD, or fabric visual data workflows.

## Latest Update Summary

Free trial/scan evaluation captured in canonical portfolio.

## What This Project Is

External hardware/tool feasibility trial for fabric/sample scanning.

## What This Project Is Not

Not confirmed production hardware rollout.

## Key Users

Sourcing, fabric, sample, data/AI stakeholders.

## Systems / Data

Fabric samples, scanned images, metadata, possible visual search/use-case datasets.

## Known Risks / Blockers

Exact hardware scope, scan quality, cost, data integration, user workflow.

## Next Actions

Evaluate trial output quality and define business fit.

